OL,3,GNEWSAStatue plan revived for London's
OL,4,Afirst black mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to commemorate London's first
OL,7,Fblack mayor have been revived, six
OL,8,Fyears after a campaign for the monument
OL,9,Fwas launched.
OL,11,FWandsworth Council has agreed to put
OL,12,F#30,000 towards a statue of John
OL,13,FArcher, elected mayor of Battersea in
OL,14,F1913.
OL,16,FThe council unanimously approved the
OL,17,Fproject in 2022, but progress stalled.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
