OL,3,GNEWSAStatue plan revived for London's
OL,4,Afirst black mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FArcher, whose father was from Barbados,
OL,7,Fmoved to Battersea with his wife,
OL,8,FBertha, in the 1890s. He was elected
OL,9,FLiberal councillor for Latchmere, where
OL,10,Fhe successfully campaigned for a
OL,11,Fminimum wage of 32 shillings a week for
OL,12,Fcouncil workers.
